	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "WGS 84 provides the 'alt' property as an RDF property, so we declare it here to enable use in OWL. However, we have not made it equivalent to hasAltitude due to the potential semantic clash for people using 'alt' with string values or numeric values with different units." .
<http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#lat> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "WGS 84 provides the 'lat' property as an RDF property, so we declare it here to enable use in OWL. However, we have not made it equivalent to hasLatitude due to the potential semantic clash for people using 'lat' with string values or numeric values with different units." .
