<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention-CSF> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS business day convention - CSF" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "convention that a scheduled date will be calculated from a formula, coupon schedule, or tenor first, then if it falls on a non-business date will be adjusted to the first following day that is a business day" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CSF" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Calculate/Shift following" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention-CSMF> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS business day convention - CSMF" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "convention that a scheduled date will be calculated from a formula, coupon schedule, or tenor first, then if it falls on a non-business date will be shifted to the first following day that is a business day unless that day falls in the next calendar month, in which case that date will be the first preceding day that is a calendar date" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CSMF" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Calculate/Shift modified following" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention-CSMP> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS business day convention - CSMP" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "convention that a scheduled date will be calculated from a formula, coupon schedule, or tenor first, then if it falls on a non-business date will be shifted to the first preceding day that is a business day unless that day falls in the prior calendar month, in which case that date will be the first subsequent day that is a calendar date" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CSMP" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Calculate/Shift modified preceding" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention-CSP> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSBusinessDayConvention> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS business day convention - CSP" ;
