	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "Indicates whether a certain PRNXT element in ARPRNX increases the principal (NT) or decreases it.\n\nApplies only for ANX, NAX, LAX Maturity CTs. For all other Maturity CTs the first principal payment is always in the opposite direction of all other (following) payments." ;
