<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm-ARRATE> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm> ;
