	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "Boundary value in a barrier options contract, when reached, triggers the boundary effect specified e.g. Knock-In or Knock-out" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "BV" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Boundary Value" .
