	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "Unique identifier of a contract.\n\nIf the system is used on a single firm level, an internal unique ID can be generated. If used on a national or globally level, a globally unique ID is required." ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CID" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Contract Identifier" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm-CLA> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS contract term - CLA" ;
	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/hasParameterName> "creditLineAmount" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Classifiers/isClassifiedBy> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTermGroup-NotionalPrincipal> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "If defined, gives the total amount that can be drawn from a credit line. The remaining amount that can still be drawn is given by CLA-NT.\n\nFor ANN, NAM, the credit line can only be drawn prior to PRANX-1PRCL.\n\nFor CRL, the remaining amount that can still be drawn is given by CLA-Sum(NT of attached contracts)." ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CLA" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Credit Line Amount" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm-CLDR> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS contract term - CLDR" ;
	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/hasParameterName> "calendar" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Classifiers/isClassifiedBy> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTermGroup-Calendar> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "Calendar defines the non-working days which affect the dates of contract events (CDE's) in combination with EOMC and BDC. Custom calendars can be added as additional enum options." ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CLDR" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Calendar" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm-CPID> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS contract term - CPID" ;
	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/hasParameterName> "counterpartyID" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Classifiers/isClassifiedBy> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTermGroup-Counterparty> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "CPID identifies the counterparty to the CRID in this contract.\n\nCPID is ideally the official LEI which can be a firm, a government body, even a single person etc. However, this can also refer to a annonymous group in which case this information is not to be disclosed. CPID may also refer to a group taking a joint risk or more generally, CPID is the main counterparty, against which the contract has been settled." ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CPID" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Counterparty Identifier" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm-CRID> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS contract term - CRID" ;
	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/hasParameterName> "creatorID" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Classifiers/isClassifiedBy> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTermGroup-ContractIdentification> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "This identifies the legal entity creating the contract record. The counterparty of the contract is tracked in CPID.\n\nCRID is ideally the official LEI which can be a firm, a government body, even a single person etc. However, this can also refer to a annonymous group in which case this information is not to be disclosed. CRID may also refer to a group taking a joint risk." ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CRID" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Creator Identifier" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm-CT-ANN> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ACTUS contract term - CT - ANN" ;
