	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/denotes> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSTaxonomy/ACTUSContractType-CapFloorOption> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasDescription> "An agreement of paying the differential (cap or floor) of a reference rate versus a fixed rate." ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "CAPFL" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTextualName> "Cap and Floor" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm-CT-CEC> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/ACTUSContractTerm> ;
