	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "classifier for a collection of ACTUS dictionary parameters that tend to be applied together" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSContractTerms/AlgorithmicContractTypesDataDictionary> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Classifiers/ClassificationScheme> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/CodesAndCodeSets/CodeSet> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/MVF/MultipleVocabularyFacility/Vocabulary> , _:c14n2782 ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Algorithmic Contract Types data dictionary" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "system of alpha-numeric symbols, or combinations of symbols, that stand for the terms in the ACTUS data dictionary, a controlled vocabulary defining the parameters that may apply to any given contract type" ;
