	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Government of Japan"@en , "日本国"@ja ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "unitary parliamentary constitutional monarchy with a bicameral legislature in Eastern Asia, bordered on the west by the Sea of Japan, and extending from the Sea of Okhotsk in the north toward the East China Sea and Taiwan in the south" ;
