	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "unitary dominant-party parliamentary elective constitutional monarchy in Southeastern Asia, located in the southern portion of the Indochinese peninsula, bordered by Thailand to the northwest, Laos to the northeast, Vietnam to the east and the Gulf of Thailand to the southwest" ;
