	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "European Union jurisdiction" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "individual representing the overall jurisdiction for the European Union, namely, that of the Court of Justice of the EU and Court of Auditors of the EU" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/adaptedFrom> "https://europa.eu/european-union/about-eu/countries_en"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> ;
