	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Bulgaria, a civil law legal system under the Ministry of Justice, including the Supreme Administrative Court and the Supreme Court of Cassation, which are the highest courts of appeal and oversee the application of laws in subordinate courts" ;
