	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of Czechia"@en , "jurisdikce česka"@cs ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of the Czech Republic, a civil law system grounded in the Constitution of the Czech Republic, including the Constitutional Court, Supreme Court, and Supreme Administrative Court, as well as district and county courts that are divided into civil, criminal, and administrative branches" ;
