	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of Moldova"@en , "jurisdicția Moldovei"@ro ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Moldova, which is the system of courts that interprets and applies the law in Moldova, including an independent Constitutional Court" ;
