	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Croatia, a civil law legal system in which law arises primarily from written statutes, influenced by German and Austrian legal systems, whose national courts include the Constitutional Court, which oversees violations of the Constitution, and the Supreme Court, which is the highest court of appeal" ;
