	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/isJurisdictionOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/EuropeanJurisdiction/SouthernEuropeGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/GovernmentOfTheRepublicOfMalta> .
