	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Note that the Courts of the United Kingdom are separated into three separate jurisdictions, the Courts of England and Wales, Courts of Scotland and the Courts of Northern Ireland, as the United Kingdom does not have a single unified judicial system, aside from the courts specifically identified in the definition of this individual." ;
