	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of Austria" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Austria (österreichische Justiz), consisting of general courts (ordentliche Gerichte) and courts of public law (Gerichte öffentlichen Rechts)" ;
