	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Salvadorian entity" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "sovereign state and polity that is bordered on the northeast by Honduras, on the northwest by Guatemala, and on the south by the Pacific Ocean" ;
	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/GovernmentEntities/hasFullSovereigntyOver> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/ISO3166-1-CountryCodes/ElSalvador> ;
