	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Argentinian entity" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "federated sovereignty and polity that is located in the southern half of South America, bordered by Bolivia and Paraguay to the north, Brazil to the northeast, Uruguay and the South Atlantic Ocean to the east, and the Drake Passage to the south" ;
	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/GovernmentEntities/hasFullSovereigntyOver> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/ISO3166-1-CountryCodes/Argentina> ;
