	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/GovernmentEntities/hasSharedSovereigntyOver> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/Alberta> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/BritishColumbia> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/Manitoba> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/NewBrunswick> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/NewfoundlandAndLabrador> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/NorthwestTerritories> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/NovaScotia> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/Nunavut> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/Ontario> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/PrinceEdwardIsland> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/Quebec> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/Saskatchewan> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-CA/Yukon> ;
	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/GovernmentEntities/isRepresentedBy> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/NorthAmericanJurisdiction/CAGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/GovernmentOfCanada> .
