	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of Antigua and Barbuda" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the Eastern Caribbean Supreme Court (based in Saint Lucia; one judge of the Supreme Court is a resident of the islands and presides over the High Court of Justice, including the Judicial Committee of the Privy Council (JCPC), which is the highest court of appeal for certain British territories, some Commonwealth countries and a few UK bodies" ;
