	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of Barbados" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Barbados, an independent branch of the Barbadian government, subject only to the Barbadian Constitution, including the Magistrates' Court, Supreme Court, and Caribbean Court of Justice" ;
