	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of Dominica" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of the Commonwealth of Dominica, which is a member of the International Criminal Court, with a Bilateral Immunity Agreement of protection with the US military, as covered under Article 98" ;
