	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "juridiction de la République d'Haïti"@fr , "jurisdiction of Haiti"@en ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Haiti, whose highest court is the Cour de Cassation, assisted by local and civil courts at a communal level" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/hasReach> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/ISO3166-1-CountryCodes/Haiti> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/isJurisdictionOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/NorthAmericanJurisdiction/CaribbeanGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/GovernmentOfTheRepublicOfHaiti> .
