	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of Jamaica" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "the jurisdiction of the judiciary of Jamaica, a system based on English common law and local statutes, including the Judicial Committee of the Privy Council (JCPC), which is the highest court of appeal for certain British territories, some Commonwealth countries and a few UK bodies" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/hasReach> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/ISO3166-1-CountryCodes/Jamaica> ;
