	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of the Saint Lucia" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Saint Lucia, a mixed judicial system based on on both the civil law and English common law" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/hasReach> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/ISO3166-1-CountryCodes/SaintLucia> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/isJurisdictionOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/NorthAmericanJurisdiction/CaribbeanGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/GovernmentOfSaintLucia> .
