	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of the Federation of Saint Vincent and the Grenadines" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Saint Vincent and the Grenadines, which is divided into district courts, the Eastern Caribbean Supreme Court and the Privy Council in London being the court of last resort" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/hasReach> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/ISO3166-1-CountryCodes/SaintVincentAndTheGrenadines> ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/isJurisdictionOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/NorthAmericanJurisdiction/CaribbeanGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/GovernmentOfSaintVincentAndTheGrenadines> .
