	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of the Dominican Republic" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of the Dominican Republic, whose highest court is the Supreme Court of Justice, composed of 16 judges appointed by the National Council of Magistrates, an entity created by the constitutional reform of 1994 to ensure the independence of the Judicial Branch" ;
