	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "jurisdiction of the Federation of Saint Christopher and Nevis" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "jurisdiction of the judiciary of Saint Kitts and Nevis, a mixed judicial system based on on both the civil law and English common law" ;
