	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "individual representing the jurisdiction of the US territory of American Samoa" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/hasReach> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/Regions/ISO3166-2-SubdivisionCodes-US/AmericanSamoa> ;
