	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "individual representing the federal government of the United States of America" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/governs> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/ISO3166-1-CountryCodes/UnitedStatesOfAmerica> ;
