<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/NorthAmericanJurisdiction/USGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/VirginIslandsJurisdiction> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/Jurisdiction> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/NorthAmericanJurisdiction/USGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/> ;
