<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/DER/DerivativesContracts/FuturesAndForwards/FinancialFuture> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "financial future"@en ;
