	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/GoalsAndObjectives/Objectives/Strategy> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "method by which adjustments will be made to the contract should one or more of a number of extraordinary events occur"@en .
