	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/Markets/operatesInMunicipality> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/BusinessCentersIndividuals/Chicago> ;
