	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Relations/Relations/hasFormalName> "New York Stock Exchange" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/explanatoryNote> "The New York Stock Exchange is a leading global cash equity exchange. It is the leading equity exchange for initial public offerings, or IPOs, globally, and enables companies seeking to raise capital to become publicly listed through the IPO process upon meeting exchange listing standards. In addition to common stocks, preferred stocks and warrants, the NYSE lists structured products, such as capital securities and mandatory convertible securities. In addition, NYSE operates NYSE Bonds, an electronic trading platform with transparent pricing for debt securities, including corporate bonds." ;
