<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/NorthAmericanEntities/USRegulatoryAgencies/FinancialIndustryRegulatoryAuthority> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/LegalEntities/FormalBusinessOrganizations/NonGovernmentalOrganization> ;
