	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "is the influence or risk borne by" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/FinancialProductsAndServices/isFacilitatedBy> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> ;
