	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/PartiesAndSituations/hasActiveParty> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/FinancialProductsAndServices/facilitates> ;
