	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "submitter" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/PartiesAndSituations/PartyRole> , _:c14n639 ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "party presenting something, such as a regulatory report" .
