	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "date on which a report was issued"@en .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Arrangements/Reporting/hasReportDateTime> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> ;
