	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/PartiesAndSituations/hasActor> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/isOwningParty> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "identifies the actor that holds title to the asset in an ownership situation" .
