	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "departamento"@es , "department"@en ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "division of a large organization such as a government, university, business, or shop, dealing with a specific subject, commodity, or area of activity" ;
