	<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/AnnotationVocabulary/preferredDesignation> "FL" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/explanatoryNote> "Labeling systems for floors vary from country to country, and may be specific to the building, for example, whether or not a 13th floor is identified as such tends to be on a case-by-case basis." .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Places/Addresses/Front> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Places/Addresses/SecondaryUnitDesignator> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "front"@en ;
