	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Designators/hasTag> "N" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Places/NorthAmerica/USPostalServiceAddresses/Northeast> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> , <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Places/Addresses/GeographicDirectionalSymbol> ;
