	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/DatesAndTimes/hasDate> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "specifies a date against which the value of a scoped measure is compared (e.g., one month prior, three months prior, etc., and typically against a prior release or average over prior releases)" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/Analytics/hasRelativeComparativePeriod> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has relative comparative period" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/DatesAndTimes/DatePeriod> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/DatesAndTimes/hasDatePeriod> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "specifies a period (typically a prior period) against which the scoped measure is compared, such as an average set of values for some period of time compared with a more recent or projected average for a forward looking period of time" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/Analytics/hasReleaseDate> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has release date" ;
