	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "specifies the date on which something is published" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/explanatoryNote> "A release date is typically a date fixed in advance for the release of a film, recording, document, report, or product or publication." .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/Analytics/hasReleaseDateTime> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> ;
