	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/DatesAndTimes/CombinedDateTime> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "specifies the date and time on which something is published" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/Analytics/hasSubtrahend> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> ;
