	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "specifies the quantity value that is subtracted from something" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/Analytics/hasTargetValue> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has target value" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/DatesAndTimes/FinancialDates/DatedStructuredCollection> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/QuantitiesAndUnits/hasArgument> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "specifies a collection of values that represent planned or projected goals or objectives for some something over time" .
