	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/Analytics/StatisticalMeasure> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is calculated via methodology" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "high-level description of the approach taken to obtain the result" .
