	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/adaptedFrom> "https://pe.usps.com/cpim/ftp/pubs/Pub28/pub28.pdf"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
