	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "document or other source from which a given definition was taken directly; the range for this annotation can be a string, URI, or BibliographicCitation" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/AnnotationVocabulary/hasMaturityLevel> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> ;
