	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/DatesAndTimes/hasDurationValue> "P60M" .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/IND/InterestRates/InterestRates/SpecificProviderInterestRateBenchmark> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> ;
