	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/IND/InterestRates/InterestRates/InterestRateBenchmark> , _:c14n1846 ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "interest rate benchmark that is made available by a specific market data provider for reference purposes" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/explanatoryNote> "Benchmarks, such as those published by Bloomberg, Thomson-Reuters, and others, are usually quoted as of a specific date and time of day." .
