	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "individual representing the European Money Markets Institute (EMMI) functional entity that is an international financial information publisher, responsible for the publication of euro-based benchmarks, including Euribor" ;
	<https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/adaptedFrom> "http://www.emmi-benchmarks.eu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> ;
