	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/PartiesAndSituations/actsOn> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/BusinessAuthorizations/isAuthorizedBy> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "endorses, enables, empowers, or gives permission to" .
