	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/CountryRepresentation/isPartOf> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Countries/CountryRepresentation/hasSubregion> ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "relates a geographic region to another geographic region that it is a part of" .
