	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "language variation" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "continuous change within and between individual languages" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Language variation may include change over time, space, cultural affiliation, etc." .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/LCC/Languages/LanguageRepresentation/LivingLanguage> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Section 3.23, ISO 639-4" ;
	a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> ;
