	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "transcription" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "the representation of speech or signing in written form" ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The resulting text is also referred to as a transcription." .
